Clipboard HTML used as paste test fixtures. None of these files ships in the npm package
("files" in package.json does not include fixtures/). Each file keeps its source's licence.

word-mac-*, excel-mac-*, gdocs-{chrome,safari,firefox}-*, gsheets-*
  Captured for OLDSUI-274 on 2026-10-17 on macOS: Microsoft Word 16.114 and Excel for Mac,
  Google Docs and Google Sheets, pasted into Chrome, Safari and Firefox Developer Edition.
  Office temp file paths and Google copy GUIDs are replaced with constants.
  Licence: the kit's licence (MIT).

word-win-firefox-*
  Microsoft Word 12 (2007) on Windows, captured through Firefox. From tinymce/tinymce at tag
  6.8.5, modules/tinymce/src/core/test/ts/module/test/PasteStrings.ts (constants table and
  wordList1; wordList2 there is byte-identical to wordList1). Temp file paths are replaced with constants.
  MIT License. Copyright (c) 2022 Ephox Corporation DBA Tiny Technologies, Inc.

gdocs-chromium-*
  Google Docs copies made in Chromium. From Mr0grog/google-docs-to-markdown at commit
  9db10842fd78288b14d73750e901d6e8799aadf9, test/fixtures/<name>.copy.html.
